%N A400070 Number of compositions (ordered partitions) of n such that (greatest part) - (least part) <= 3.
%F A400070 G.f.: Sum_{j>=1} x^j / ( (1 - x^j - x^(j+1) - x^(j+2) - x^(j+3)) * (1 - x^(j+1) - x^(j+2) - x^(j+3)) ).
%e A400070 a(6) = 30 because among the 32 compositions of 6 only [5,1] and [1,5] (difference 4) are excluded.
%t A400070 nmax = 35; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^j/((1 - x^j - x^(j + 1) - x^(j + 2) - x^(j + 3)) (1 - x^(j + 1) - x^(j + 2) - x^(j + 3))), {j, 1, nmax}], {x, 0, nmax}], x] // Rest
